<title>SINGAPORE: Soccer-Tiger Cup results.</title>
<headline>Soccer-Tiger Cup results.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1996-09-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results of Tiger Cup soccer matches on Friday:</p>
<p>Group B</p>
<p>Thailand 6 Brunei 0 (halftime 3-0)</p>
<p>Scorers: Santawong (15th), Sri-Tongin (23rd, 87th), Srimaka (35th, 67th), Senamuang (77th)</p>
<p>Attendance: 8,000</p>
<p>Singapore 3 Philippines 0 (2-0)</p>
<p>Scorers: Ahmad (20th, 42nd), Lim (73rd)</p>
<p>Attendance: 12,000</p>
<p>Standings (tabluated under played, won, drawn, lost, points)</p>
<p> Singapore   3  2  1  0  7</p>
<p> Thailand    2  2  0  0  6</p>
<p> Malaysia    2  1  1  0  4</p>
<p> Brunei	2  0  0  2  0</p>
<p> Philippines 3  0  0  3  0</p>
<p>Top two qualify for semifinals on September 13</p>
</text>
